<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62032" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάταξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰγος</span>, ἡ</span>, usu. in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάταγες</span>, in the game of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότταβος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the drops
				of wine in the bottom of the cup which were thrown into a basin
				with a splash</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάταγες ποτέονται κυλίχναν ἀπὺ Τηΐαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ᾽ ἀγκύλης . . ἵησι λάταγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					273
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				47.7
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				2.2
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				102
			</span></i>: so collectively in sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξανθὴ Ἀφροδισία λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					277
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a water-quadruped</i>, perh. beaver, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				487a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				594b32
			</span></i>.</div>
